{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Panopticon is a mystery adventure set in the daily routine in a caf\u00e9.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powered by Unreal Engine and Meta Human, the realistic game environment immerses the player as a barista, uncovering the secrets hidden within the caf\u00e9.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What truth lies behind the boss\u2019s surveillance and the red door?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505600/extras/435ee130a074aa9f23c067c9f77bb39d.poster.avif?t=1772103368\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505600/extras/435ee130a074aa9f23c067c9f77bb39d.webm?t=1772103368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505600/extras/435ee130a074aa9f23c067c9f77bb39d.mp4?t=1772103368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Caf\u00e9 Tasks</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brew coffee like a real barista, interact with customers, and experience daily caf\u00e9 life through diverse key inputs and quick-time events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505600/extras/792be2512ff9c361a5a4b54edcd7057c.poster.avif?t=1772103368\" width=600 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505600/extras/792be2512ff9c361a5a4b54edcd7057c.webm?t=1772103368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505600/extras/792be2512ff9c361a5a4b54edcd7057c.mp4?t=1772103368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rich Story with Cinematic Presentation</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a story\u00a0with escalating tension.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conversations between high-resolution Meta Human characters deliver an experience like watching a short film.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203b Some of the scenes include jump scares.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The Perfectionist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3505600/53bd9a3f2824f9e5eec7db55b567c76de503e5ca.jpg"},{"name":"86","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3505600/53bd9a3f2824f9e5eec7db55b567c76de503e5ca.jpg"},{"name":"I beat you","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3505600/53bd9a3f2824f9e5eec7db55b567c76de503e5ca.jpg"},{"name":"Clever Guy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3505600/53bd9a3f2824f9e5eec7db55b567c76de503e5ca.jpg"},{"name":"Ending A","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3505600/53bd9a3f2824f9e5eec7db55b567c76de503e5ca.jpg"},{"name":"Ending B","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3505600/53bd9a3f2824f9e5eec7db55b567c76de503e5ca.jpg"},{"name":"Desk Jumping","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3505600/53bd9a3f2824f9e5eec7db55b567c76de503e5ca.jpg"},{"name":"The Collection","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3505600/53bd9a3f2824f9e5eec7db55b567c76de503e5ca.jpg"}],"total":8},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3505600?t=1772103368","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3505600?t=1772103368","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505600/7522d9fb4abdda07d94e3ab4